# ============================================================================
# SEC-CIBER.5 - .htaccess hardening template v2 (origen: documentacion/plantilla_htaccess.md)
# Blacklist IPs + Options -Indexes + security headers + UAs ofensivos/bots.
# Caveat Cloudflare: con el proxy CF delante, "deny from <IP>" solo ve la IP de
#   Cloudflare. Activar mod_remoteip (bloque comentado abajo) o mover la
#   blacklist a Cloudflare -> IP Access Rules (plan free ~1000 reglas).
# ============================================================================
#<IfModule mod_remoteip.c>
#    RemoteIPHeader CF-Connecting-IP
#    # Whitelist rangos Cloudflare (https://www.cloudflare.com/ips/)
